0 // Technic Gear 15 Large Tooth (trans_clear)
1 47 -90 160 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 570.DAT
0 SYNTH END
0 // Study 3: The final loop explores a more compact route using the smaller coarse-toothed wheels.
